            "conclusion": "For `L` divisible by all `q ∈ Qset R` and `a` supported coprime to `L`, `F_R(β) = Σ_{Ψ mod L} ‖S_{Ψ⁻¹}(β)‖² (c/φ(c)) κ_c G_{c̃}(m_R(β)/c̃)` with `c = cond Ψ`; proof by Bombieri's identity and `weight_sum`."
